==Battleground==
*3 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ayumi Manbosaki]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**25 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
**25 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 6.67~8.33 seconds<sup>200f~250f</sup>.
**25 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
**25 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

